tellites to orbit. The NSSL program has two parts. Lane 1 covers the Space Force's more risk-tolerant missions, such as medium-lift launches with experimental payloads or rideshare missions carrying satellites for the Pentagon's surveillance or data relay constellations . Lane 2 includes higher-priority strategic missions, like the government's largest and most expensive spy satellites, or radiation-hardened communications satellites designed to survive a nuclear war. Read full article Commentsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;AahxTyR4QwdCp0KPE8BtGu7VX5dwGid7iPWTIne9rh4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;44rHiv6X4BW7B_tWCvXX5MRprKwDI10kfmP5dbdViVsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;qBsGOpAO0bYuJLsrEq6nD3t4tr1lpSVcOuJT2VX8oRIƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;cValkM8HOmJBUzPVGU-jrOf2832FPTnCtVKbOAxlOqEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;0LPgMEzvBZ7q8km8a_1RVVyLkupFsU6VID7UPTv7FrIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;iWSamZPe4f5QfVHAwgzUAAxfVPnaCEyGMGhDOhQVbtQƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;7p1H_56qhGuftX-FkC7Xlm0DTLtcf254cTAKYv1YWcwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Bo5w0eIirA-iULW51_x_CPQ2qwWJCJCEJ5lWBa2IBXgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkqSyndicationSourceƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;01rge5VX7uLSvsJtekdveHM6o